Your melee and ranged attacks inflict distracting wounds that reduce the target’s critical strike multiplier by [20%, 33%, 42%, 48%, 53% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.

In addition, your attacks have a [9%, 17%, 22%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] chance to inflict a painful wound that causes them to forget a random talent for 4 turns.  The last effect cannot occur more than once per turn per target.
